OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fcloudy, with some clear spells in the
OL,7,Feast. The cloud will bring showery
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain or drizzle, chiefly
OL,9,Fover the hills and mountains in the
OL,10,Fwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA dull and cloudy start, with
OL,13,Fa continued chance of light rain and
OL,14,Fdrizzle through the morning. Becoming
OL,15,Fdrier and brighter during the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Feeling very warm in the
OL,17,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
