OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FPatchy
OL,6,Frain in the north and west on
OL,7,FWednesday. Fine elsewhere with locally
OL,8,Fhot sunshine. Some showers possible on
OL,9,FThursday, otherwise staying fine,
OL,10,Falbeit cooler.
